## 10. Current Operating Workflow

The preferred command interface remains compatible with the historical runbook.

### Report only

```bash
python sg_reconcile_engine.py \
  --info-file sg_config_ready.json \
  --report-only
```

### Dry-run

```bash
python sg_reconcile_engine.py \
  --info-file sg_config_ready.json \
  --dry-run
```

### Apply

```bash
python sg_reconcile_engine.py \
  --info-file sg_config_ready.json \
  --yes \
  --approve-target ACCOUNT_ID:REGION:VPC_ID
```

The explicit target approval is an additional safety mechanism.

The actual target account, region, and VPC must match the authenticated AWS identity and configuration.

Do not run apply against the real DR environment until discovery, mapping approval, and dry-run behavior have been validated.

